{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id110137164"}, "name":{"label":"Chiqlet"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2014-11-09T20:41:01-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"1"}, "im:version":{"label":"1.1"}, "id":{"label":"1094634500"}, "title":{"label":"Forget this!!!"}, "content":{"label":"The app just keeps crashing. It won't let you sign in. I've uninstalled and reinstalled it 3 times. It's been doing this for weeks. \n\nIt used to work great. Now it's just taking up space on my phone. Am going to delete it permanently and just use the direct website. \n\nI suggest to anyone considering downloading this app, don't bother. Just use the website. \n\nI have to give it one star because it won't let me post the review otherwise. It really isn't even worth that.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=606923858&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id151777298"}, "name":{"label":"DiverTJ"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2013-09-02T19:05:03-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"1"}, "im:version":{"label":"1.1"}, "id":{"label":"864454372"}, "title":{"label":"Help menu does not work"}, "content":{"label":"This \"app\" is fair until you open the help menu.  Once the help menu is open, the only way to get back to the app is to uninstall.   Using the mobile web site is easier and more interactive ... Don't bother with the app.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=606923858&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id33729518"}, "name":{"label":"RastaSailor"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2013-08-28T15:02:22-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"1"}, "im:version":{"label":"1.1"}, "id":{"label":"861841062"}, "title":{"label":"This is not an APP...it's a way to access the web"}, "content":{"label":"I can't believe they call this an APP... It is not an App, but rather a way to access the website... Which is SUPER user-UN-friendly via an iPhone, the website isn't even responsive! You can't pinch/zoom at all, and you have to scroll all over the place to view what you need to find. When family/friends of those in need have to QUICKLY get info out to members or sign people up, doing so via this \"App\" is not a solution... VERY disappointed by this whole process :-(", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=606923858&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
