{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id30804244"}, "name":{"label":"BlueSkye44"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2013-05-08T15:26:44-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"1.0.1"}, "id":{"label":"801352516"}, "title":{"label":"A caregiver's lifesaver!"}, "content":{"label":"I've used Lotsa Helping Hands to coordinate caregiving for years.  The  mobile app is just as good, if not easier!  No crashing, as another user experienced and I've used it a lot since it was released. Great to have on-the-go when you need to check who has signed up for different tasks. This app is a Godsend.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=606923858&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id323391179"}, "name":{"label":"swmoore13"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2013-04-18T10:17:17-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"2"}, "im:version":{"label":"1.0.1"}, "id":{"label":"790228615"}, "title":{"label":"Crashes when adding to calendar"}, "content":{"label":"I have been considering using this for coordinating care of a loved one for a while so wanted to test out the app (iPhone only, no iPad app). Created an event, assigned it to myself and every time it asks if I want to add to my calendar and I say yes, it crashes. Froze upon reopen 2 out of 4 times I tried to get back in. Not useful or trustworthy if there are glitches like this.  Thanks for trying, look forward to an update.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=606923858&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}], "updated":{"label":"2026-11-01T15:17:45-07:00"}, "rights":{"label":"Copyright 2008 Apple Inc."}, "title":{"label":"iTunes Store: Customer Reviews"}, "icon":{"label":"http://itunes.apple.com/favicon.ico"}, "link":[
